BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mad Bills to Pay
DTSTART:20260531T204500Z
DTEND:20260531T225500Z
DTSTAMP:20260531T204500Z
UID:p3R5ZieUPr
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 111 mins (1h51m)\n\nRico’s summer is a wild mix of
  chasing girls and hustling homemade cocktails out of a cooler on Orchard 
 Beach\, the Bronx. But when Destiny\, his teenage girlfriend\, crashes at 
 his place with his family\, it’s only a matter of time before his rowdy\
 , carefree days come spiraling down.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-the
 aters/mad-bills-to-pay\n\nEstimated start: 14:00
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
